OL,3,AFish and eggs al desko? The dos and
OL,4,Adon'ts of the lunch break
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are two types of office workers:
OL,7,Fthose who eat lunch al-desko, and those
OL,8,Fwho have to endure the smell of
OL,9,Feveryone else's.
OL,11,FFew things are more likely to test
OL,12,Fworkplace relationships than the person
OL,13,Fsitting next to you proudly unveiling a
OL,14,Fcontainer of reheated fish.
OL,16,FFrom tuna sandwiches and boiled eggs to
OL,17,Fcrumbly and sticky treats that leave a
OL,18,Fmess on the keyboard, what is
OL,19,Fconsidered OK to eat in the office can
OL,20,Fbe surprisingly divisive.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
